    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You take on a spectral, angelic form that grants you the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Angelic Wings.</strong> You have a Fly Speed of 90 feet.</p><p><strong>Spectral Form.</strong> You have Resistance to Bludgeoning, Piercing, Radiant, and Slashing damage.</p><p><strong>Holy Empowerment.</strong> Whenever you cast a spell with a spell slot that restores Hit Points to one or more creatures or deals Radiant damage, determine its effects as if you had used a spell slot 2 levels higher (maximum level 9).</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-76ITS34pL12UrxOf\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>For Holy Empowerment, choose a level 2 higher in the usage dialog of those spells.</p></section>",
